        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86699, Industrial Chic Jasper Cabinet Finger Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIndustrial looking, modern finger cabinet pulls are becoming quite popular in the contemporary kitchen. These stylish Jasper Cabinet Knobs, are a comfortable 2 inches in length with a 1-3/8 inch projection. Choose from 6 modern finish colors. Emtek's Industrial Chic Jasper Cabinet Finger Knob comes packaged with the mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86699-specifications.gif?v=1704354730\" width=\"362\" height=\"213\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek 86699 specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/jasper-cabinet-pull-emtek-86686\"><b>Emtek Jasper Cabinet Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/jasper-appliance-pull-emtek-ap-86693\"><b>Emtek Jasper Appliance Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Emtek Jasper Cabinet Finger Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Diameter: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
